# The age key that decrypts every *.sops.yaml in this repository. It belongs on the
# machine that bootstraps the cluster, never in git. The patterns cover the names it
# gets copied around as - age.agekey, age.agekey.bak, backup.agekey - because
# ignoring only the literal `age.agekey` leaves the backup of the one file that
# decrypts the whole cluster still committable.
age.agekey*
*.agekey

# Environment files, which is where a value gets pasted while debugging.
.env*

# Cluster credentials that end up in a working directory: kubeconfigs, and the key
# material cert-manager and Velero hand out. Nothing tracked today matches these,
# so this is a safety net, not a rule about the repository's layout.
*.kubeconfig
kubeconfig
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# Node dependencies of the app repositories that used to live here; harmless if one
# is ever cloned into a subdirectory.
node_modules/
